>
  <p>
    My passion for Formula 1 began in 2019 when I watched Netflix's Drive to
    Survive. The series introduced me to the intense rivalries, strategic
    brilliance, and cutting-edge engineering that define the sport. Since then,
    I've become an avid fan, following every season closely and immersing myself
    in the world of motorsport. Growing up, I spent countless hours playing Gran
    Turismo on the PlayStation 2, which sparked my love for racing and cars.
    More recently, I've enjoyed playing F1 23 and F1 24. Attending the 2024
    United States Grand Prix at Circuit of the Americas (COTA) in Austin was a
    dream come true, especially witnessing the Porsche GT Cup in action.
  </p>

  <p>
    Professionally, I specialize in digital media innovation and web
    development, leveraging tools like Microsoft Power Platform to streamline
    operations and create immersive user experiences. My background includes
    managing digital strategies for small businesses, where I developed
    comprehensive marketing campaigns and optimized online presence. With
    certifications in Power Apps, Power Automate, and Power BI, I bring
    expertise in automating workflows and visualizing data to drive efficiency
    and engagement. My skills in UI/front-end design and data analytics allow me
    to craft intuitive, visually appealing interfaces that enhance user
    satisfaction. Combining my technical expertise with my passion for
    motorsport, I aim to create digital experiences that resonate with Formula 1
    fans and celebrate the sport's rich history.
  </p>

  <p>
    Through this website, I hope to share my love for Formula 1 with fellow
    enthusiasts. Whether it's showcasing driver profiles, race calendars, or
    championship standings, my goal is to deliver content that captures the
    excitement and innovation of the sport. Formula 1 is more than just a
    pastime for me—it's a source of inspiration and a way to connect with others
    who share the same passion for speed, strategy, and cutting-edge technology.
    By blending my professional skills with my personal interests, I strive to
    create a hub where fans can explore the world of F1 and celebrate the
    moments that make it truly unforgettable.
  </p>

  <p>
    In conclusion, this website is a reflection of my journey as a Formula 1 fan
    and digital media innovator. It combines my professional expertise in web
    development, data analytics, and digital storytelling with my personal
    passion for motorsport. Whether you're here to explore driver profiles, race
    calendars, or championship standings, I hope this platform serves as a hub
    for fans to celebrate the speed, strategy, and innovation that make Formula
    1 truly extraordinary. Thank you for visiting, and I look forward to
    connecting with fellow enthusiasts as we share our love for the sport.
  </p>
</Layout>
